<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n72457" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἰνά̆ρ-ιον</span></b> , τό, 
			Dim. of
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἶνος,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>weak</i> or <i>bad wine,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.
				35.32
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Alex.
				275
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Diph.
				60.8
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Polioch.
				2.7
			</span></i>, etc.: pl., <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				1672.5
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i A. D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>a little wine,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Diocl.Fr.
				141
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Epict.
				<u>Ench.</u>
				12
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				1.64
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				11.189
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Lucill.
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> colloq.
			for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἶνος,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Char.</u>
				17.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PEleph.</u>
				13.5
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span> : pl., <i><span class="en">
				<u>PCair.Zen.</u>
				373
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ostr.Bodl.</u>
				iii 369
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄμπελος</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				19.125
			</span></i>.</div>
